<title>GERMANY: BMW to announce 1996 results March 25.</title>
<headline>BMW to announce 1996 results March 25.</headline>
<dateline>MUNICH, Germany 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bayerische Motoren Werke AG (BMW) will report profit figures for 1996 and other details of its financial performance at its annual news conference on March 25, a company spokesman said.</p>
<p>Analysts said they expected the company to report net income for 1996 of 800 million marks or higher. In 1995, BMW earned 692 million marks. The news conference will start at 0900 GMT.</p>
<p>BMW reported on January 30 that group revenue last year climbed 13.3 percent to 52.27 billion marks.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom + 49 69 756525</p>
</text>
